      "side": 1,
      "message": "@zhidou@google.com the issue here is that `wear-services` is transitively using flags from `services`, while `services` is optimizing flag usage independently of that downstream usage. Would the right approach here be to use go/repackage_flags for flags used in system server (particularly the `services.jar` target).",
      "parentUuid": "d8c619d1_98cfcda0",
      "revId": "f161085ed85a21042a68cb9cad360c20c2c6c776",
