        "id": 1064003
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T21:32:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re not yet ready to repackage or jarjar isolate flags, one thing we could do is proxy flags referenced downstream in wear services with a wrapper, e.g.,\n\n```\npackage com.android.server.flags;\n\nimport static com.android.media.audio.Flags.ringerModeAffectsAlarm;\n\n@KeepForApi(description\u003d\"Flags referenced in downstream system server jars\")\npublic class ExportedFlags {\n    public static boolean ringerModeAffectsAlarm() {\n         return ringerModeAffectsAlarm();\n    }\n    \n    // ... Any other flags that might be transitively referenced\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 57,
        "startChar": 60,
        "endLine": 57,
        "endChar": 65
      },
      "revId": "f161085ed85a21042a68cb9cad360c20c2c6c776",
